&lt;li&gt;Fluency in AI tools and workflow automation platforms (e.g., Dust, Gong, Clay, Claude, n8n), curiosity to always stay up to date on innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce expertise and rigorous data governance instincts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change leadership — the ability to bring teams and stakeholders through transformation with conviction and clarity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial acumen across both Enterprise and SMB motions&lt;/li&gt;
