&lt;h3 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-lg s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our Connect EMEA team led by Jane Barge, VP Connect. Launched in 2020, Mirakl Connect has grown from a network linking sellers and marketplace operators into a comprehensive seller platform with 20,000+ sellers. With the launch of Channel Manager in 2024, it now enables sellers to scale across 450+ marketplaces and agentic channels, while continuing to expand through AI-powered capabilities, ads management, financial services, and an app store.&amp;nbsp;The team consists of around 20 people across Europe, spanning Account Executives, Account Managers, Partnerships, and Customer Success, organized to address both SMB and Enterprise clients. Together, you&#39;ll be driving Mirakl Connect&#39;s expansion in the European brand and marketplace ecosystem.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;For Enterprise deals, we run dedicated Deal Clinics to ensure every opportunity gets the right focus, coaching, and support from the team. And when we win, we celebrate together: every closed deal rings the office bell, gets shouted out in our dedicated Slack channel, and is celebrated as a team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&quot;We&#39;re building something truly unique at Mirakl Connect. This is a fast-growing product with enormous potential, and we&#39;re looking for someone who wants to be part of shaping it. If you thrive in an entrepreneurial environment, love winning big deals, and want to make a real impact, this team is for you.&quot;&lt;/em&gt; — Jane Barge, VP Connect&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-my-4 s-border-b s-border-primary-150 dark:s-border-primary-150-night&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
