&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;1. The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our Product Marketing team led by &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/danielle-delahunty-james-b976205/&quot;&gt;Danielle Delahunty-James&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/strong&gt; VP of Product Marketing. The team consists of 5 Product Marketing Managers based across Paris and London. Together, you&#39;ll be translating product innovation into clear, compelling stories that help customers understand, adopt, and succeed with Mirakl&#39;s solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&quot;Marketing brings Mirakl&#39;s products to life through stories that help customers see the value and act with confidence.&quot;&lt;/em&gt; — Danielle Delahunty-James, VP of Product Marketing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;2. Your Impact&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead go-to-market strategy and own the narrative:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive end-to-end GTM planning and execution across Mirakl&#39;s core platform — partnering with Product, Sales, Customer Success, and Marketing to deliver coordinated, high-impact launches, while crafting differentiated messaging that turns complex platform capabilities into clear enterprise value propositions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the voice of the market:&lt;/strong&gt; Bring customer, competitive, and market insights into product and GTM strategy, keeping Mirakl ahead in a fast-evolving eCommerce and AI-driven landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empower global sales teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver best-in-class enablement, tools, and narratives that help teams win in competitive enterprise deals across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Move at product speed:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with high-velocity product teams to ensure every release lands with clear messaging and full GTM readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
